<applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAYAMA SHOJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKENAKA SHIGEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOKYO SHIBAURA ELECTRIC CO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KABUSHIKI KAISHA TOSHIBA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAYAMA, SHOJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKENAKA, SHIGEO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAYAMA SHOJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKENAKA SHIGEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAYAMA, SHOJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKENAKA, SHIGEO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An active Ba film, for example, is formed as a gettering film in a vacuum atmosphere on a face plate (10) having a phosphor layer and a metal back layer formed on a base. While maintaining the vacuum atmosphere, the face plate (10) is opposed to a rear plate (20) having electron emitting devices as an electron source formed on a base with a spacing by means of a support frame (30) and the spacing is hermetically sealed. A flat image display (40) has, for example, an active Ba film formed as a gettering layer on a metal back layer. Such a gettering film, maintaining an active state, is disposed in an image display region in a vacuum enclosure and has a good gettering function.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>On forme, par exemple, un film Ba actif en tant que film à usage de getter dans une atmosphère sous vide sur une plaque frontale (10) revêtue d'une couche de luminophore et d'une couche de fond métallique formée sur une base. Tout en maintenant le vide, on met en opposition la plaque frontale (10) et une plaque postérieure (20), pourvue de dispositifs émetteurs d'électrons en tant que source d'électrons formée sur une base, cette plaque postérieure étant séparée de la plaque frontale par un bâti de support (30). L'espace séparant les plaques est hermétiquement clos. Cet afficheur plat (40) est pourvu, par exemple, d'un film Ba actif formé en tant que film à usage de getter sur une couche de fond métallique. Ce film à usage de getter, faisant perdurer un état actif, est mis en place dans une zone donnée d'afficheur d'images dans une enceinte sous vide et témoigne de bonne caractéristiques d'usage de getter.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>